      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Cortejo. Emitir ondas sonoras poderosas deixa Swoobat exausto, impedindo-o de voar por algum tempo. O formato auspicioso de seu nariz fez com que algumas regiões passassem a considerá-lo um símbolo de boa sorte.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 7 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 5 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo, Voador &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 2/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Swoobat é a evolução final de Woobat.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Assurance, Confusion, Gust, Odor Sleuth</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Heart Stamp</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Air Cutter, Imprison</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Attract</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Amnesia, Calm Mind</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Air Slash</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Future Sight</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Psychic</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Endeavor</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Simple Beam</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acrobatics, Aerial Ace, After You, Air Slash, Ally Switch, Assurance, Attract, Calm Mind, Charge Beam, Charm, Confide, Defog, Double Team, Dream Eater, Dual Wingbeat, Embargo, Endeavor, Energy Ball, Expanding Force, Facade, Fake Tears, Fly, Frustration, Giga Drain, Giga Impact, Gyro Ball, Heat Wave, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Hyper Beam, Imprison, Knock Off, Laser Focus, Light Screen, Magic Coat, Protect, Psych Up, Psychic, Psycho Cut, Psyshock, Rain Dance, Reflect, Rest, Return, Roost, Round, Safeguard, Shadow Ball, Shock Wave, Signal Beam, Skill Swap, Sky Attack, Sleep Talk, Snore, Speed Swap, Steel